      "title": "3D from a photo: a GLB with Meshy 7.1",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 3D from a photo: a GLB with Meshy 7.1\n\nLoads your photo of one object, sends it to Meshy 7.1 through Comfy's partner node Meshy: Image to Model, and saves the textured model it returns as a GLB file.\n\n## Models\n\n- Meshy 7.1 runs on Meshy's service, under [Meshy's terms](https://www.meshy.ai/terms-of-use) and [Comfy's terms](https://www.comfy.org/terms-of-service). No weights load on your machine.\n\nMeshy bills your Comfy account in credits through your Comfy key. Sign in to Comfy, or pass your key, before you run it.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT."
      ],
